#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:5
msgid "Text field"
msgstr "文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:7
msgid ""
"The normal text field is an object that displays a static text. Once the "
"`element`_ has been created, the text can only be changed if the `element`_ "
"is edited. Any different value can be introduced from outside of the "
"`element editor`_."
msgstr ""
"普通文本字段是显示静态文本的对象。一旦创建了 `元件 <element_>`_，只有编辑了 `元件 <element_>`_ "
"文本才能更改。任何不同的值都可以从 `元素编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 外部引入。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:12
msgid "Create text"
msgstr "创建文本"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:14
msgid "The text field can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "文本字段只能从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:16
msgid "Select the icon |icon_text| from `toolbar`_ to add a text field."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_text| 以添加文本字段。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:19
msgid "icon_text"
msgstr "图标( T)"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:17
msgid "Click the positional point from the text in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "单击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中文本的位置点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:23
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:26
msgid "Text properties"
msgstr "文本属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:28
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "元素部分属性可以在选择该部分时从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr "如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 信息** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech text field part from element"
msgstr "图：来自元素的QElectroTech文本字段"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:40
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different text properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的文本属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "职位安排"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Position"
msgstr "立场"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:46
msgid "The text coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "文本坐标(x,y)可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Text angle"
msgstr "文本角度"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:50
msgid ""
"The text display angle can be defined in the range of 0 to 360 degrees."
msgstr "文本显示角度可以定义为0到360度。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:56
msgid "The text size can be defined."
msgstr "文本大小可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/text.rst:60
msgid "The color text can be chosen between black and white."
msgstr "颜色文本可以在黑白之间选择。"
